**Title:** Lesson Plan- (Pre K - K): Creation Day 3

**Objectives:** The children will be able to

- identify that God created land and plants on the third day
- identify that God gathered the waters under the heavens into one place
- identify that God called the dry ground land and the gathered waters seas
- identify that God said, "Let the land produce vegetation: seed-bearing plants and trees on the land that bear fruit with seed in it"

