### Circle Time:

Read story: “Creation Day 3” from your own story book. Then ask questions from below.

- What did God do on the third day? (Gathered the waters under the heavens into one place)  
- What did God call the dry ground? (Land)  
- What did God call the gathered waters? (Seas)  
- What did God say? ("Let the land produce vegetation: seed-bearing plants and trees on the land that bear fruit with seed in it")  
- What did God create on the land? (Vegetation: seed-bearing plants and trees that bear fruit with seed in it)  

