# Lesson Plan- (Pre K - K): Daniel and the Lions

**Date:** Sunday, March 14, 2010

**Title:** Lesson Plan- (Pre K - K): Daniel and the Lions

**Objectives:** The children will be able to

- retell the story of Daniel and the lions
- identify that Daniel prayed to God even when it was against the law
- identify that God shut the lions'' mouths
- discuss why we should pray to God

**Review:** Prayer and questions from last week’s lesson.

**Vocabulary Words:**  
[Daniel and the Lions Word Wall](https://1drv.ms/b/s!Ar6LKlEjjtdHz3Ps7LOiggUueboW) 

**Plan:**

### Circle Time:

Read story: “Daniel and the Lions” from your own story book. Then ask questions from below.

- Why was Daniel thrown into the lions'' den? (Because he prayed to God when it was against the law)  
- What did the king do when he learned Daniel was thrown into the lions'' den? (He was sad and fasted for Daniel)  
- What happened to Daniel in the lions'' den? (God shut the lions'' mouths)  
- What did the king do to the men who accused Daniel? (He had them thrown into the lions'' den)  
- What did the king say about God? (He is the living God and he endures forever)  

### Songs and/or Finger Plays:

- [dltk-bible.com - Daniel Song](http://www.dltk-bible.com/guides/daniel-song.htm)  

### Activities:

- [dltk-bible.com - Daniel and the Lions Lesson](http://www.dltk-bible.com/guides/daniel-lions.htm)  

### Crafts:

- [dltk-bible.com - Lions Den Craft](http://www.dltk-bible.com/guides/daniel-lions-craft.htm)  

### Games:

- [sundayschoolgames.com - Daniel and the Lions Game](http://www.sundayschoolgames.com/games/daniel-lions.htm)  

### Snacks:

No specific snacks.

### Coloring/Puzzles:

- [sermons4kids.com - Daniel and the Lions Coloring](http://www.sermons4kids.com/daniel_lions_colorpg.htm)  

### Disclaimers:

[Standard]

